88480,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4iiMRA","name":"CliRelay_0.5.3_linux_amd64.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/gzip","state":"uploaded","size":16462780,"digest":"sha256:fbbbbdf56dfd9020cc383a3b10047c56eb2292ffd5befc1c909658f365b1cb15","download_count":8,"created_at":"2026-09-21T16:13:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T16:13:37Z"},{"id":579388478,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4iiMQ-","name":"CliRelay_0.5.3_linux_arm64.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/gzip","state":"uploaded","size":15106097,"digest":"sha256:93192424e878c2e8957d3513f83ea0396d0b6521e1a1c3c80283f6241e724d00","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-21T16:13:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T16:13:36Z"},{"id":579388477,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4iiMQ9","name":"CliRelay_0.5.3_windows_amd64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":16806530,"digest":"sha256:3e6be26cba6179454eec372ac508e701789a0e168ac2ff5ca3910215989a27fa","download_count":9,"created_at":"2026-09-21T16:13:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T16:13:37Z"},{"id":579388479,"node_id":"RA_kwDORZ9jAc4iiMQ_","name":"CliRelay_0.5.3_windows_arm64.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":15234281,"digest":"sha256:b136580e0180019f3c80be929ac2e1a39b907f85c0a1016c46d7768ac3efdfa3","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-21T16:13:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T16:13:36Z"}],"body":"# v0.5.3 - 上游响应模型记录、模型禁用强化与调度窗口重置折扣 / Upstream Response Model Recording, Model Disable Enforcement and Reset-Aware Quota Discount\n\n## 核心更新亮点 / Highlights\n\n### 1. 上游响应模型溯源与透明审计 / Upstream Response Model Tracking\n* **真实返回模型记录**：完整记录上游在响应体中声明的真实模型名称（`response_model`），并在请求日志中与请求模型对比呈现。\n* **模型降级与替换透明化**：当上游实际返回模型与客户端请求模型不一致时，在日志分析与监控面板中自动标识差异，便于快速审计渠道降级行为。\n\n### 2. 模型禁用全链路生效与目录隔离 / Model Disable Enforcement and Catalog Isolation\n* **禁用状态全链路拦截**：彻底打通模型目录中的禁用开关（disable toggle），对常规推理、Gemini 原生 URL 端点及 WebSocket 路径均严格生效。\n* **管理端目录与公共目录分流**：管理端运维界面保留已禁用模型的展示与配置入口，而面向外部客户端及租户的公开模型列表自动过滤已禁用模型。\n\n### 3. 额度重置折扣调度与客户端兼容 / Reset-Aware Quota Discount & Client Compatibility\n* **额度窗口重置感知调度**：`LeastLoadSelector` 智能结合账号额度窗口的剩余重置时间计算惩罚系数，临近重置周期（6h/48h 梯度）时自动降低负荷惩罚，释放即将刷新的配额，避免额度浪费。\n* **Pi 与 Codex CLI 路由兼容**：直接从根路径为 Codex CLI 与 Pi 的 CLIProxyAPI Provider 提供端点兼容与客户端专属模型目录适配。\n* **Claude Fable 5.1 支持与指纹门禁升级**：模型库正式引入 Claude Fable 5.1 代际模型；提升 Claude Code 指纹门禁基线并适配符合要求的客户端 User-Agent。\n* **Antigravity 跨节点重试与错误解码**：当遭遇地区限制（location-gated）时自动跨节点重试并设上限，正确解码上游压缩错误响应体。\n\n---\n\n## 详细改动记录 / Detailed Changes\n\n### 后端 CliRelay\n- **feat(usage)**：在请求日志中记录上游在响应中声明的真实模型，与请求模型做比对记录（#1056）。\n- **fix(models)**：修复模型目录禁用开关未在运行时全面生效的问题，覆盖 Gemini 原生与 WebSocket 路由，并在公共端点中正确过滤（#1047, #1057）。\n- **feat(api)**：在 Relay 根路径为 Codex CLI 与 Pi 客户端提供端点与目录兼容（#1048, #1057）。\n- **feat(registry)**：在模型库中注册 Claude Fable 5.1 代际模型（#1049, #1057）。\n- **fix(claude)**：升级 Claude Code 指纹基线，支持合规客户端 UA（#1050, #1057）。\n- **fix(antigravity)**：对遭遇地区限制的请求在下一个可用节点重试（最多 2 次）（#1051, #1057）。\n- **fix(claude)**：正确解压上游压缩的错误响应体，避免错误信息截断损坏（#1052, #1057）。\n- **feat(scheduling)**：引入基于重置窗口时间的配额折扣机制，最大化利用即将刷新的配额（#1055, #1057）。\n- **fix(antigravity)**：单配额池耗尽不再导致整个账号标记不可用（#1046）。\n\n本次更新与前端 codeProxy v0.5.2 协同发布。多架构二进制包与 Docker 镜像已发布至 GitHub Release 与 GHCR。\n"}
